{"id":"658255","name":"炖地三鲜","author":"美食家_XYDl_jjVM","authorId":"13134901","desc":"","cover":"images/658255/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"|个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"|个"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"|个"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"开水","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜1个去皮洗净。","img":"images/658255/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成三角块备用.","img":"images/658255/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"茄子也切成三角块放在碗里放点盐洗净备用。","img":"images/658255/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里倒油烧热。","img":"images/658255/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入茄子油炸一下。","img":"images/658255/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/658255/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入胡萝卜块炒一下。","img":"images/658255/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒匀加土豆块炒匀。","img":"images/658255/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"青辣椒洗净切块备用。","img":"images/658255/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅里加少量开水。","img":"images/658255/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"碗里倒入腐乳汁。","img":"images/658255/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"酱油及盐搅匀。","img":"images/658255/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入开水。","img":"images/658255/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒在锅里慢火炖10分钟。","img":"images/658255/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658255/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}